Mikey Butler will captain Ireland with pride in Saturday evening’s Hurling-Shinty International against Scotland in Supervalu Páirc Uí Chaoimh.
He never imagined he’d ever even get to play the compromise code, so the opportunity to lead out his country is something the tenacious Kilkenny defender regards as</div><div class="text-primary-light mb-4 text-[0.875rem] leading-normal font-black uppercase max-md:mb-0">Tuesday 20 October 2026</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="h-full"><div class="flex h-full flex-col shadow-[0px_4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] max-md:h-28 max-md:border-b max-md:py-[0.44rem] max-md:shadow-none"><div class="flex h-full flex-col max-md:flex-row max-md:gap-2"><div class="max-md:h-27 max-md:w-30"><a href="https://www.gaa.ie/article/adrian-mullen-excited-about-henry-shefflin-s-appointment-as-kilkenny-manager" class="h-full w-full"><picture><source srcSet="https://www.gaa.ie/api/images/image/private/t_ratio16_9-size50/prd/tlbr875bpxc1fgk00z2i" media="(min-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://www.gaa.ie/api/images/image/private/t_ratio16_9-size30/prd/tlbr875bpxc1fgk00z2i" media="(min-width: 769px)"/><img alt="Adrian Mullen excited about Henry Shefflin&#x27;s appointment as Kilkenny manager" loading="lazy" width="416" height="234" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-none h-full w-full object-cover object-center max-md:h-27 max-md:w-30" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gaa.ie%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fimage%2Fprivate%2Ft_ratio16_9-size30%2Fprd%2Ftlbr875bpxc1fgk00z2i&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gaa.ie%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fimage%2Fprivate%2Ft_ratio16_9-size30%2Fprd%2Ftlbr875bpxc1fgk00z2i&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gaa.ie%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fimage%2Fprivate%2Ft_ratio16_9-size30%2Fprd%2Ftlbr875bpxc1fgk00z2i&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/></picture></a></div><div class="ml-4 flex flex-col justify-center gap-1 pt-[0.87rem] pr-1 max-md:ml-0 max-md:h-full max-md:w-[13.43rem] max-md:pt-[0.45rem]"><div class="mb-[0.56rem] flex gap-2 max-md:mb-[0.38rem]"><a href="/news/tag/hurling"><div class="flex"><div s